sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as CLI Command Parser
    participant CLIENT as HTTP Client
    participant SERVER as HTTP Server
    participant VAL as Validation Module
    participant CAT as Category Service/Repo
    participant TX as Transaction Service
    participant TREPO as Transaction Repository
    participant STORE as Local Storage

    User->>CLI: add --type expense --amount "10000" --category food --date 2026-03-28
    CLI->>VAL: Validate required fields and amount/token rules
    VAL-->>CLI: Valid

    CLI->>CLIENT: Serialize request to JSON
    CLIENT->>SERVER: POST /transactions (localhost HTTP)
    
    SERVER->>VAL: Validate request body
    VAL-->>SERVER: Valid

    SERVER->>CAT: Verify category exists (default/custom)
    CAT-->>SERVER: Category found

    SERVER->>TX: Create transaction request (normalize amount to amountMinor)
    TX->>TREPO: Save transaction entity
    TREPO->>STORE: Persist local-only data
    STORE-->>TREPO: Saved
    TREPO-->>TX: Transaction ID + metadata
    TX-->>SERVER: Success response
    SERVER-->>CLIENT: HTTP 200 + JSend success
    CLIENT-->>CLI: Deserialize response
    CLI-->>User: English confirmation output

    alt Invalid input
        VAL-->>CLI: {code, message, field?, hint?}
        CLI-->>User: Show structured error in English (exit code 2)
    end

    alt Server error
        SERVER-->>CLIENT: HTTP 5xx + JSend error
        CLIENT-->>CLI: Deserialize error
        CLI-->>User: Show server error message (exit code 3)
    end